<title>USA: HFS, Public Storage in vender pact.</title>
<headline>HFS, Public Storage in vender pact.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said Monday it has entered a three-year preferred vendor agreement with Public Storage Inc to co-market storage space to franchisees and customers of HFS's three real estate brands.</p>
<p>The agreement provides certain pricing discounts for CENTURY 21, Coldwell Banker and ERA franchised brokerages and their customers on enclosed self-storage rental space. The real estate brands have about 11,200 franchised offices in North America, Puerto Rico, Europe, Africa and Asia, HFS said.</p>
</text>
